# The other packages. This image is the bot: the Android app is built by
# `flet build` and never runs here, and the content pipeline runs on a
# workstation. Their source would only be dead weight in the layer -- the
# pipeline's manifest is kept because uv reads every workspace member's
# pyproject.toml to resolve the lock.
packages/app/
packages/extraction/src/
packages/extraction/README.md

